# Scenario name
msgid "Locust Swarm"
msgstr "Locust Swarm"

# Scenario description
msgid ""
"What happens when you're attacked by a swarm of locusts?\n"
"\n"
"Designed to run with one or more player ships with different terrain each "
"time.\n"
"\n"
"Version 1\n"
"\n"
"USN Discord: https://discord.gg/PntGG3a where you can join a game online. "
"There's one every weekend. All experience levels are welcome."
msgstr "What happens when you're attacked by a swarm of locusts?\n\nDesigned to run with one or more player ships with different terrain each time.\n\nVersion 1\n\nUSN Discord: https://discord.gg/PntGG3a where you can join a game online. There's one every weekend. All experience levels are welcome."

